<section class="card"><h1>Allocate freight, duty and fees</h1><p>Choose actual deliveries on one purchase order and a posted expense bill. This prepares a cost calculation for review. Quantities, supplier balances and payments stay the same.</p>
<form method="get" action="/autopilot/landed-costs/new"><label>PO or delivery reference <input name="receiptSearch" value="<%= receiptSearch %>" maxlength="120"></label><label>Fee bill number or description <input name="expenseSearch" value="<%= expenseSearch %>" maxlength="120"></label><button class="btn">Find the source records</button></form></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Choose the recorded costs and goods</h2>
<% if(!receipts.length||!expenses.length){ %><p>Both a recorded delivery and an unallocated posted expense are needed. Search by their actual reference numbers.</p><% } %>
<% if(receiptMore||expenseMore){ %><p>The latest 50 matching source records are shown. Use the search fields to find a specific older PO, delivery or fee bill.</p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/landed-costs"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="requestKey" value="<%= requestKey %>">
<label>Recorded deliveries <select name="receipts" multiple required size="5"><% for(const r of receipts){ %><option value="<%= r.id %>"><%= r.po_number %> · <%= r.reference||r.receivedLabel %></option><% } %></select></label><p>Choose one to 20 deliveries from the same PO, with at most 100 received product lines. Goods already sold or moved need an individual accounting review.</p>
<label>Posted freight, duty or fee line <select name="expense" required><option value="">Choose the actual expense</option><% for(const e of expenses){ %><option value="<%= e.id %>"><%= e.bill_number %> · <%= e.description %> · <%= helpers.money(Number(e.available_minor),currency) %> left to allocate</option><% } %></select></label>
<label>Amount to allocate in <%= currency %> <input name="amount" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Leave blank for the remaining posted amount"></label>
<label>What the recorded charge covers <select name="category" required><option value="">Choose the source charge type</option><option value="freight">Inbound freight</option><option value="duty">Duty</option><option value="insurance">Inbound insurance</option><option value="handling">Inbound handling</option><option value="other">Other — approve individually</option></select></label>
<label>Allocation method <select name="method" required><option value="">Choose how to split the recorded cost</option><option value="quantity">Received units</option><option value="value">Original recorded product cost</option><option value="weight">Recorded unit weight</option></select></label><button class="btn" <%= !receipts.length||!expenses.length?'disabled':'' %>>Prepare cost allocation</button></form></section>
<p><a href="/autopilot/reviews/landed-costs">Back to received-goods costs</a></p>
